error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::island(...)` cannot call parent browser helper `rsjs::window::inner_width`

       Why:
         Explicit child islands hydrate independently. Parent-side browser work cannot be smuggled through the server-rendered boundary expression.

       Use one of:
         - Give the child island its own browser helper call.
         - Render the child directly inside the parent island if parent browser state must feed it.
         - Pass plain server data across the explicit island boundary.

       Tracked feature:
         server_boundary.browser_helper
